# Files/dirs excluded from Claude Code's search & glob (Grep/Glob/Explore),
# but still readable directly by path when actually needed.
# Purpose: keep broad codebase searches from scanning large/binary/
# generated files that are never relevant to a code change.

package-lock.json
logs/
*.log

# Service-account / device config blobs — binary-ish, never edited by hand
src/utils/firebase-service-account.json
